<title>CANADA: Extendicare announces share buyback.</title>
<headline>Extendicare announces share buyback.</headline>
<dateline>MARKHAM, Ontario 1996-11-22</dateline>
<text>
<p>Extendicare Inc said on Friday that it would redeem all its 1,017,332 outstanding class I convertible preferred shares at $25 a share on December 23.</p>
<p>Extendicare will also pay on each share a C$0.2065 cent amount equal to all dividends accrued and unpaid up to the redemption date, the company said.</p>
<p>-- Reuters Toronto Bureau 416-941-8100</p>
</text>
